00\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Rates were suppressed for case counts <20 because they are unstable as a result of the small number of deaths\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Relative change was calculated using the equation: (2020 rate–2019 rate)/2019 rate x 100.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}